'''Map Mod Manager''' provides an in-game tool to easily check for incompatibilities between [[Mapping|map]] mods. It will use check the [[Mapping#Cells|cells]] currently being shared between two map mods and indicate if they [[Load order#Mapping|conflict]] or not.

== See also ==
* [[Mapping]]
* [[PZ Map Analyser]]

